{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a journalist chasing a story that should have stayed buried. Drawn by rumors and whispers, you arrive at an abandoned asylum hidden deep within the forest. What begins as an investigation quickly unravels into a fight for survival as the walls themselves seem to breathe with secrets long silenced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with your notebook, camera, and determination, you must uncover the truth about <i>The Silent Ward</i>. But be warned: some truths don\u2019t want to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every locked door hides a story. Every corridor leads deeper into fear. And in the silence, something is watching\u2026 waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017000/extras/2e0137fc6b2256eee0efb4b4f6de888e.poster.avif?t=1767253662\" width=1170 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017000/extras/2e0137fc6b2256eee0efb4b4f6de888e.webm?t=1767253662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf0 <strong>Play as a Journalist</strong> \u2013 Experience the horror through the eyes of an investigator, driven to uncover the asylum\u2019s chilling past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Uncover the Story</strong> \u2013 Collect documents, interview echoes of the past, and piece together what happened inside the ward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd <strong>Puzzles &amp; Clues</strong> \u2013 Solve environmental puzzles and interpret notes to unlock hidden passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude31 <strong>Psychological &amp; Supernatural Horror</strong> \u2013 Encounter unpredictable scares, from shifting environments to entities that blur the line between reality and nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Cinematic Beginning</strong> \u2013 Start your journey on a lonely dirt road, driving toward the asylum that will test your courage\u2014and your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017000/extras/30fb4f31ee47ee5a83742389b5758722.poster.avif?t=1767253662\" width=1170 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017000/extras/30fb4f31ee47ee5a83742389b5758722.webm?t=1767253662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017000/extras/30fb4f31ee47ee5a83742389b5758722.mp4?t=1767253662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017000?t=1767253662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017000/4c6e8b09c4101e1d1d322ef4eb0d793711cd0616/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767253662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017000/73b2e04deac239e17c3a2f37a86b73bc215ee0ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767253662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017000/73b2e04deac239e17c3a2f37a86b73bc215ee0ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767253662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6